**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/.venv/
**/*.egg-info
**/build/
!/build/
# Unity-generated IDE files (*.csproj, *.sln) are ignored by each Unity project's own
# .gitignore (apps/*, packages/unity/*, legacy/Outernet.Client). Hand-authored library
# solutions live under packages/csharp and packages/generated/csharp, so no blanket *.sln
# rule belongs here — it would only block those.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/bin.meta
**/obj.meta
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.vs
.act
.env
.secrets
metadata.json
storage/
tidy-commits.json
.build-version.json
artifacts/
.pnpm-store/
.placeframe/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock